@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing true

actor User
participant "index.html\n(Momentum Dashboard UI)" as UI
participant "momoSiteInterop.js\n(Content Script)" as Interop
participant "siteBlocker.js\n(Content Script)" as Blocker
participant "serviceWorker.js\n(Service Worker)" as BG
database "Dexie IndexedDB\n(Local Storage)" as DB
participant "site-blocker.html\n(Iframe Block Page)" as BlockerUI
participant "momentumdash.com\n(Main Website)" as Web

User -> UI : Open New Tab
UI -> BG : Fetch cached profile settings
BG -> DB : Read setting state / authState
DB --> BG : Return state
BG --> UI : Display custom widget, todo lists, backgrounds

User -> Web : Load main site
Web -> Interop : Trigger page load hooks
Interop -> BG : sendMessage(momentum:getUserId)
BG -> DB : Read active user UUID
DB --> BG : Return UUID
BG --> Interop : Return userUuid
Interop -> Web : Inject UUID hidden input into DOM
Web -> Interop : window.postMessage("momentum:oneTimeLogin", payload)
Interop -> BG : sendMessage("oneTimeLogin", payload)
BG -> UI : updateSenderTab URL with login details
UI --> User : Display logged-in account status

User -> Blocker : Visit blocked focus site
Blocker -> Blocker : Extract og:site_name & page title
Blocker -> BlockerUI : Instantiate iframe?hostname=...&sitename=...
BlockerUI -> Blocker : postMessage("momentum-intervention:show")
Blocker -> User : Show fullscreen overlay site blocking modal
@endum
